              <li><strong>Browse API</strong> &mdash; $8/1K requests, 8 clients integrating</li>
              <li><strong>Node Client</strong> &mdash; Desktop app (Win/Mac/Linux)</li>
              <li><strong>9,000+ social followers</strong> &mdash; 440 developer waitlist</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Converting Now</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>8 LOI-signed clients</strong> &mdash; contracts in legal review</li>
              <li><strong>First invoices</strong> &mdash; scheduled this quarter</li>
              <li><strong>Revenue is a timing function</strong>, not a sales risk</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ 8. TEAM ============ -->
