          <div class="q-y-label-bottom">Low (Local/Serial)</div>
          <div class="q-x-label-left">Centralized</div>
          <div class="q-x-label-right">Distributed<br/>Human-like</div>
          <div class="q-y-title">AI Workload Scale</div>
          <div class="q-x-title">Execution Environment</div>
